TRUE COMMAND STRUCTURE - SEALED
CLASSIFIED. NOT FOR THE GENERAL MEMBERSHIP.

The organisation obeys Pain. Pain obeys another.

The masked man who moves among us as "Tobi" is the true architect. He wears the name
of Madara Uchiha. Pain and Konan believe they lead the Dawn toward Nagato's dream of
peace through shared pain; in truth they execute the first phase of a plan that is not
theirs. The tailed beasts, the Statue, the whole apparatus - all of it serves the
handler's design, the Eye of the Moon.

The membership is compartmented deliberately. Each pair knows its task and its ring.
None knows the whole. Deidara, Sasori, Hidan, Kakuzu, Kisame - tools, well made and
well used, and nothing more.

Should you have come to read this by accident, you have read too far. The plan does
not require your belief. Only your ring, and your silence.
